# FIRE repo map

FIRE ENGINE (Failure Investigation & Root Explanation) diagnoses incidents in watched systems
from payload shapes and process paths, never raw values. Hexagonal; the package is `fire/`.
Rules naming a `panoptes/` package or `config/panoptes.yml` describe Panoptes, another repo,
and do not apply here.

| Path | What lives there |
|---|---|
| `fire/core/domain/` | Pydantic models: `dossier` (`Shape`, `ShapeField`, `ValueType`, `ShapeFingerprint`, `ProcessPath`, `EvidenceFragment`, `Dossier`), `decision` (`Possibility`, `Decision`), `incident`, `narration`, `origin`, `inventory` (`SystemInventory`, `CoverageReport`), `observation` (`Channel`, `ShapeObservation`, `SpanObservation`, `SpanLink`, `StreamSummary`, `FingerprintSummary`), `ingest` (`IngestReport`, `IngestCounts`, `Rejection`, `RejectionReason`) |
| `fire/core/ports/` | Protocols: `Reasoner`, `Narrator`, `Notifier`, `ObservationCatalog`, `ShapeGeneralizer`, `ShapeFingerprinter`, `ManifestParser` |
| `fire/core/services/` | `DiagnosisService` (reasoner, then narrator, then notifier), `IngestService` (checks and stores observations), and `audit_coverage` |
| `fire/adapters/shapes/` | `FlatStarShapeGeneralizer` (JSON to `Shape`), `Sha256ShapeFingerprinter` |
| `fire/adapters/manifests/` | `EventChainsGraphParser` (`event_chains_graph` document to `SystemInventory`) |
| `fire/adapters/memory/` | `MemoryObservationCatalog`: in-process, lost on restart |
| `fire/adapters/{reasoners,narrators,notifiers}/` | Stubs: `EchoReasoner`, `TemplateNarrator`, `ConsoleNotifier` |
| `fire/apps/config.py` | YAML to Pydantic: `FireConfig` (`config/fire.yml`), `SystemConfig` (`config/systems/*.yml`) |
| `fire/apps/discovery.py` | `discover`: per system, an inventory from its manifest or a `missing_reason` |
| `fire/apps/env.py` | `load_fire_env`: loads `.env`; process env wins |
| `fire/apps/incident_engine/` | `app.py` (FastAPI: `GET /health`, `POST /v0/diagnose`, `POST /v0/observations`, `GET /v0/systems/{system}/streams`), `wiring.py` (`build_container`), `__main__.py` |
| `config/fire.yml` | Global: API token env var, reasoner, narrator, notifier, tier budgets |
| `config/systems/` | One YAML per watched system; `_template.yml` is skipped. `omg.yml` is OMG, the first |
| `tests/unit/` | Flat `test_<topic>.py` files |
| `tests/integration/` | API tests through `TestClient`, with config written to `tmp_path` |
| `tests/conftest.py` | Skips `omg_local` tests unless `OMG_REPO` is set |

## Specs

`docs/specs/` holds the contracts. Read the matching spec before changing a module.

| Spec | Covers |
|---|---|
| `dossier-and-decision.md` | `core/domain/dossier.py`, `core/domain/decision.py` |
| `shape-generalizer.md` | `adapters/shapes/flat_star.py` |
| `system-config-and-discovery.md` | `apps/config.py`, `apps/discovery.py`, `inventory`, `coverage`, `adapters/manifests/` |
| `observations.md` | `core/domain/observation.py`, `core/domain/ingest.py`, `core/services/ingest.py`, `ObservationCatalog` and its memory adapter, the ingest and streams endpoints |
| `ingest-drift-and-feedback.md` | Proposal: tentacle, observations, drift, triggers, feedback; steps in `docs/roadmap.md` |
| `tentacle.md`, `http-and-span-capture.md`, `flows-and-paths.md` | Proposals: the tentacle and its sources, span and HTTP capture, flows and paths |

## Dependency rule

`core` imports only `pydantic` and the standard library, never `adapters` or `apps`.
`adapters` import `core`; `apps` import both. Relative imports are banned (ruff `TID`).
`core` names no watched system: no `omg`, and no OMG event, processor, or service names.

Update this map when a module is added, moved, or removed.
